.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-rc1/verdict-rc1-4.txt-26-   **FILE:LINE:** `.github/workflows/smoke-install.yml:18`, `:135`; dependency at `scripts/tests/smoke-install.sh:244`.  
.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-rc1/verdict-rc1-4.txt-27-   **Concrete failure scenario:** Both path filters include the smoke wrapper but omit `scripts/tests/run-activated-workflow.py`, which parses and executes the delivered workflow. A PR changing only that runner does not trigger Smoke Install, allowing its execution proof to regress unnoticed. This is an additional instance of condition 80’s trigger-gap class.  
