.claude/plans/PLAN-192/repass-ga/verdict-ga-1.txt:9:- **P1 — Signed known-open: stale bindings can block legitimate resumes.** [`.claude/hooks/_lib/launch_ledger.py:487`](/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/repass-ga.fxIjzL/wt/.claude/hooks/_lib/launch_ledger.py:487) and [line 640](/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/repass-ga.fxIjzL/wt/.claude/hooks/_lib/launch_ledger.py:640). After intentionally changing A → B, a torn latest binding or failed binding append leaves A authoritative. Probes reproduced B being blocked; the append-failure probe also accepted A as `match`. Declared by condition **10** and the incorporated round-3 annex. **Minimal fix:** make incomplete history and uncommitted newer resumes inconclusive instead of trusting the older baseline.
